  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While fighting Qiao Si Liu at a damaged Southern Border super Gu formation, Fairy Miao Yin grows to four arms and steadies her defense against willow attacks. This is immortal killer move Wondrous Hand Profound Sound, her signature move; Qiao Si Liu knew of it. Her four hands move rapidly; finger contacts make sharp sounds that become sound waves spreading a few hundred steps from her, and those waves break the damaged third formation layer many times as quickly.",
      "chapters": [
        1351
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qiao_si_liu",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "sys_super_gu_formation",
        "char_fairy_miao_yin",
        "sys_killer_moves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan recognizes Fairy Miao Yin using her trump card Wondrous Hand Profound Sound against Bay Pavilion’s storey building water elephants; translucent sound waves cover three water elephants, injuries accumulate as the waves follow them, and the three are killed. He knows the move because it originated from Purple Mountain True Monarch, whose inheritances Fang Yuan holds.",
      "chapters": [
        1377
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-origin",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "house_bay_pavilion",
        "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Feng Jiu Ge sees her already display the signature move and notes that she cultivates sound path like him.",
      "chapters": [
        1421
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sound-path-note",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Zheng reads that Fairy Miao Yin holds the Profound Sound true inheritance and that wondrous hand profound sound can be raised alongside its core Immortal Gu until it reaches rank eight. In that same fight she grows five new arms for seven in total, and sound waves storm onto Demon Judgment Board.",
      "chapters": [
        2061
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "core-gu-rank",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_zheng",
        "inh_profound_sound_true_inheritance",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "house_demon_judgment_board"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Multi-arm cast at Fire Plain grotto-heaven.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fire-plain-cast",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_fire_plain_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Fire Plain grotto-heaven she activates Wondrous Hand Profound Sound with six translucent pink arms formed by the move besides her two original arms, profound sounds attack in all directions, and she envelops three rank seven experts in a huge battlefield.",
      "chapters": [
        2107
